-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

                                   RLDEV-RUST

           An unofficial development toolkit for AVG2000 and RealLive

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
                                   CHANGELOG
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

-- 1.1.0 - 2026-08-07 --

ADDENDUM:

  Added full support for RealLive DBS format:
    .dbs <-> .dbs.bin.toml (default)
    .dbs -> .dbs.bin (--to-bin)
    .dbs -> .dbs.csv (--to-csv)

RLTOML:

  Added "--to-bin" option to decompress ".dbs" to the raw ".dbs.bin."
  Added "--to-csv" option to extract DBS data to CSV in the CSV2DBS layout.

-- 1.0.0 - 2026-07-07 --

ADDENDUM:

  First release of RlToml: “Converter between RealLive auxiliary data formats
  and TOML”.
  
  Formerly known as "RlXml", this new version rewritten in Rust includes
  everything from Haeleth's RlXml. Currently supports only .gan (G00 Anim).

RLTOML:

  First release.
  Added detailed hex dump to verbose mode.
  Added "-u / --uppercase" option to use uppercase hex digits in the hex dumps
  (default: lowercase).

